  "findings": [
    {
      "area": "immediate finish latch outside emitter cleanup",
      "status": "source clear",
      "lines": "964-970,973-1005",
      "finding": "_finish sets_finished/paused and disables NativeTickProbe physics synchronously, then only schedules _finish_deferred. The finalizer runs after the tick_finished emission stack returns and owns probe/free/Game cleanup. No native combat or stop rule changed."
    },
    {
      "area": "interarm boundary",
      "status": "source clear",
      "lines": "776-800,253-260",
      "finding": "Original-to-candidate retirement also pauses/disables probe and schedules a deferred worker. It awaits a SceneTree-owned completion signal, not the retired Game/Probe. Capture occurs while bindings are live. Candidate continuation requires persisted precleanup, cleanup_ok and evidence_error empty; _finished check afterawait prevents continuation after watchdog finish."
    },
    {
      "area": "single finalizer and pending watchdog",
      "status": "source clear",
      "lines": "786-800,973-976",
      "finding": "Only one interarm close is queued. _finalizer_started is set only after _component_close_active becomes false. A queued finalizer observing an active boundary returns; boundary completion always queues it again if_finished latched. Deferred worker emits its completion after clearing active. No blocking wait or finalizer recursion found; emission resumes _run synchronously but any resulting finish is again deferred."
    },
    {
      "area": "raw-first mechanical verdict and complete trace",
      "status": "source clear",
      "lines": "907-961",
      "finding": "Each boundary serializes copied actual open component, prior closed components, source observations, full checks/failures, actual verdict/reason and native success/counterfactual flags before Level.exit/Game.free/Probe.free. Native types stay var_to_bytes with explicit binding metadata. Unique pre-cleanup-NN.bin plus strict readback/SHA/roundtrip/flush and JSON summary have cleanup_pending=true and noacceptance; prior receipts remain immutable. Max two boundaries per invocation follows sole _run plus guarded finalizer."
    },
    {
      "area": "cleanup and positive-result gating",
      "status": "source clear",
      "lines": "803-816,978-1005",
      "finding": "Normal attached Level.exit/Game.free and WeakRef assertions occur after provisional artifacts. Final trace/report follow actual cleanup. Difference/exit0 require both native successes, old counterfactual, cleanup_ok, every precleanup receipt, no evidence error/assertions, accepted finalraw and persisted finalsummary. Persistence failures latch_precleanup_all_ok=false, deny nextarm and positive exit. Precleanup mechanical flags alone never certify cleanup or acceptance."
    },
    {
      "area": "source preservation",
      "status": "verified exact bytes",
      "lines": "whole exact diff",
      "finding": "Exact supplied patch reconstructs0dd7 fromc0b7. All34 named mechanical function body extents,37 source controls,2 embedded helper strings,NativeTickProbe and6 fixed constants match. All18 new owned files match owner8e52; prior30 files match physical/currentcommit/parent4419. Only lifecycle/output orchestration changes. Original failed c0b7 retains Host2/API1/Popen-15 and no native report/trace; constructor447/0 stays separate positive format/direct-restore evidence, not combat/policy."
    }
